toolId=aadhaar-photo-resizer dbTranslation={"toolSlug":"aadhaar-photo-resizer","locale":"en","title":"Aadhaar Photo Resizer","description":"Quickly resize, crop, and compress your passport-size photo to official UIDAI specifications for Aadhaar card updates, student cards, and government online applications.","faq":[{"question":"What is the official photo size for Aadhaar updates?","answer":"The official size is 35mm x 45mm (3.5 cm x 4.5 cm), with the head and shoulders centered and occupying 70% to 80% of the photo area on a white background."},{"question":"How does the size compression work?","answer":"Portals like UIDAI often require photos to be strictly under 50KB or 20KB. Our system uses an iterative binary search algorithm to compress the image bytes to fit exactly within your requested KB target."},{"question":"Is my uploaded photo private?","answer":"Yes, absolutely. Background removal, face cropping, color replacement, and size compression are executed on your local device. We do not store or transmit your photos."},{"question":"Can I use this for other government exams?","answer":"Yes. While optimized for Aadhaar, you can select standard passport dimensions and custom background colors/KB sizes to meet SSC, UPSC, and State exam criteria."}],"seoTitle":"Aadhaar Photo Resizer – Free Online Tool","seoDescription":"Resize, crop, and compress passport photos for Aadhaar, UIDAI, and official government updates."} lpFound=false lpTitle=undefined resolvedTitle=Aadhaar Photo Resizer – Free Online Tool
